OL,3,GNEWSA'I kept coach Bennell's abuse
OL,4,Asecret until mum died'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA survivor of paedophile football coach
OL,7,FBarry Bennell says he waited until his
OL,8,Fmother died before going to the police
OL,9,Fbecause he did not want to burden her.
OL,11,FDavid Lean was among the boys abused by
OL,12,Fthe ex-Crewe Alexandra coach and
OL,13,FManchester City scout, also known as
OL,14,FRichard Jones, during the 1970s, 80s
OL,15,Fand 90s.
OL,17,FBennell was jailed for more than 30
OL,18,Fyears in 2018 after he was convicted of
OL,19,F50 child sexual offences against 12
OL,20,Fboys. He died in prison five years
OL,21,Flater, aged 69.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
